{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34190","headline":"赠远 · 陆龟蒙","name":"赠远","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芙蓉匣中镜，欲照心还嬾。\n本是细腰人，别来罗带缓。\n从君出门後，不奏云和管。\n妾思冷如簧，时时望君暖。\n心期梦中见，路永魂梦短。\n怨坐泣西风，秋窗月华满。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34190.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34190","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}